  "description": "\nOverworked and exhausted, Joowon flees to Phuket on a much-needed vacation and meets a handsome guy named Aiden. Their one-night stand feels like a dream to Joowon, but the money Aiden leaves behind as a \"tip\" is a rude awakening. Feeling insulted, Joowon goes back to work, only to learn that Aiden is the bigshot model he'll be working with on his next project! With his boss making unreasonable demands, the only way Joowon can get the stubborn Aiden to cooperate is to do whatever he wants. And that includes picking up where they left off on their one-night stand...\n\n_Source: Tappytoon_",
